  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT US</p><h1>We move more than<br /><em>parcels.</em></h1><p>We help move the trust between a business and the person waiting on the other side.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container prose-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</p><h2>Logistics with people at the centre.</h2></div><div><p>Deliverio Express is building courier and delivery services for individuals, online sellers and businesses in Pakistan. We believe shipping should be understandable, accessible and designed around real business needs.</p><p>Our initial operational focus is Karachi, with wider shipping supported by partner networks where available. Service coverage, rates and delivery timelines are confirmed at booking.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section dark-section"><div class="container split-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR COMMITMENT</p><h2>Every parcel matters.</h2></div><div><p>Clear communication, thoughtful handling and practical technology guide the service we are working to build. As our network grows, our goal is to make shipping easier for the businesses and customers who rely on it.</p></div></div></section>
